{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our facility! Here, you\u2019ll experience the thrill of strategic duels \u2013 block attacks, acquire ammo, and shoot your opponent. We hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are similar to rock, paper, scissors: Both players make decisions at the same time. They have three options: block, get ammo, and shoot. In order to shoot, the player needs to get ammo first, but if the opponent shoots when the player gets ammo, they get shot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends or Strangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.poster.avif?t=1759758325\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.webm?t=1759758325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.mp4?t=1759758325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends or use  matchmaking to connect with other  <span class=\"bb_strike\">nasty</span> friendly guests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.poster.avif?t=1759758325\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.webm?t=1759758325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.mp4?t=1759758325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the upper hand with powerful ability cards that can turn the tide of any duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Edit Your Face</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.poster.avif?t=1759758325\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.webm?t=1759758325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We understand the importance of self-expression. Customize your helmet and show the world your true face \u2013 or at least, the one you want to show.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301930?t=1759758325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/fdc7aab43f4c1e58cf842cd275bc0ac9b4c105c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759758325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/555668481805de0642aead8b3fe39b3a9d4cc41a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759758325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/555668481805de0642aead8b3fe39b3a9d4cc41a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759758325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Panopticon depicts violence and blood."},"demos":[{"appid":3917410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"